  "standalone_adaptations": [
    "Composer-only module dependencies and assets/jobs database",
    "Root .env and target-local runtime paths; no runtime data copied",
    "Missing provider fails explicitly; no local Codex CLI/cache fallback",
    "Public static paths restricted to images, reports PDF endpoint, and health endpoint",
    "Empty asset installation returns []; upload decoding is limited to 25 MB and 40 million pixels",
    "Mutations reject non-loopback origins, unexpected local ports, null origins and Sec-Fetch-Site cross-site",
    "Local model caches resolve inside the standalone tree by default; no weights copied",
    "Persist safe browser-facing job errors; explicit known missing-key guidance and no raw provider error/log disclosure",
    "OpenAI-only migration: legacy flash/premium modes now select low/high quality on OPENAI_IMAGE_MODEL (default gpt-image-2), including AI asset extraction",
    "Visual QA now uses OpenAI Responses with a real strict JSON schema and OPENAI_VISION_MODEL (default gpt-5-mini); existing semantic and report approval validators retained",
    "One OPENAI_API_KEY, official endpoint pinned, SDK automatic retries disabled, vision store=false; malformed/refused/incomplete responses remain unverified",
    "Historical webapp/modelark.py and its three transport-mocked tests retained only for source provenance; no active imports or API routes use it"
  ],
